{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24348","headline":"长斋月满携酒先与梦得对酌醉中同赴令公之宴戏赠梦得 · 白居易","name":"长斋月满携酒先与梦得对酌醉中同赴令公之宴戏赠梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斋宫前日满三旬，酒榼今朝一拂尘。\n乘兴还同访戴客，解酲仍对姓刘人。\n病心汤沃寒灰活，老面花生朽木春。\n若怕平原怪先醉，知君未惯吐车茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}